# R&S xDWstreaming Package (`rsxdwstreaming`)

This package allows you to
- create PDWs (basic, expert), TCDWs, ADWs and CDWs
- stream those descriptor words to connected devices.

# [>>Here you can find the full documentation<<](https://1g-public.page.rsint.net/instrument-support/rsxdwstreaming/)

